.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt KEXTUNLOAD 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm kextunload
.Nd unload kernel extensions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl qv
.Op Fl b Ar bundle_id ...
.Op Ar kext ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
unloads the kernel extensions given by path
.Pq Ar kext
or by identifier
.Pq Fl b Ar bundle_id ,
through IOKit's kext functions.
Their services are terminated and their personalities removed first; an
extension in use (another depends on it, or it cannot stop) stays loaded,
and the kernel's reason is printed.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl b Ar bundle_id
Unload the extension with this identifier; it may be repeated.
.It Fl q , Fl v
Accepted for compatibility.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kextload 8 ,
.Xr kextstat 8
